OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged after Sean Graham
OL,4,Abookmakers memorial damaged            
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has been charged    
OL,7,Fwith offences including criminal damage
OL,8,Fafter a memorial in south Belfast was  
OL,9,Fvandalised.                            
OL,11,FPaint was thrown over a plaque         
OL,12,Fdedicated to the victims killed in the 
OL,13,FSean Graham bookmakers attack.         
OL,15,FFive people were murdered in the Ulster
OL,16,FDefence Association attack on the      
OL,17,FOrmeau Road in 1992. Seven other people
OL,18,Fwere injured.                          
OL,20,FThe man is expected to appear before   
OL,21,FBelfast Magistrates' Court on 18       
OL,22,FDecember.                              
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
